[{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_00 -480"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_01"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0010","text":"……\n嗯～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_02"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0020","text":"……雏菜\n发生什么事了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0030","text":"有事～……\n没有平时的味道～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0040","text":"啊——，那个巧克力零食……\n今天换了个口味啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_03"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0050","text":"不是雏菜想换才换的哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0060","text":"来事务所的路上\n没有甜的东西不行吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0070","text":"……不过，偶尔换换也不错\n一直吃同一种味道，舌头会习惯的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0080","text":"你看，不是有“换换口味”这种说法嘛……偶尔换一下，\n就能体会到平时那个味道的可贵之处"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0090","text":"啊～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_04"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0100","text":"用这种想法去品尝的话\n说不定会比现在吃得更开心呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_","text":"cam_05"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300400_01_0110","text":"Motion"}]
